###Text
Text test::duskyhatchery3::doc::RearingOverview
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# Hatchery Rearing Register\n\nBrood batches of fry are reared in tanks, and every tank belongs to a facility site held in a\nseparate schema. Batch labels are folded from the species and batch codes, and the object tree\nfrom batch to tank to site is reachable through two relational association implementations.\n';
}

###Text
Text test::duskyhatchery3::doc::EndpointNotes
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# Endpoint Notes\n\nThree single-execution endpoints are published over the rearing register: a filtered tree fetch\nfor one batch, a paginated window over the ordered batch register, and a site fetch carrying its\nnested collection of tanks.\n';
}
